== G-ratio: G_cosmo / G_N = 1 exactly at linear order: on FRW A = 0, so rho_K at fixed charge is MK1's (no H dependence); around Q = 1 the Y-term's coefficient M_2'(Y) (Q-1)^2 vanishes at linear order. The Horava-like coefficient eta_eff = 4 K F_Y,tot = 2 (c_law - R) is printed per reading above.
